# Project handoffs (BSOD Analyzer)

**Overrides pack archive convention for this repo.** Full detail: [`docs/handoffs/README.md`](../../docs/handoffs/README.md).

| Artifact | Lifetime |
|----------|----------|
| `docs/handoffs/SESSION.md` | Rewrite each session — catch-up only |
| `docs/handoffs/active/HANDOFF_*.md` | **Delete** when WQ row → Done |
| `docs/WORK_QUEUE.md` / `docs/ROADMAP.md` | Durable status — Done log, Active, Approved intent |

**Forbidden:** `handoff_archive/`, standing status/orientation handoffs, duplicating WQ tables in SESSION.

Pack baseline still applies for registry tables and one session opener line: `generic-agent-handoff-discipline.mdc`.
